S16          "Step 16"        0 3 1      enum Off On Tie Accent               | Step 16 of the row: Off, On, Tie (holds the note before it) or Accent
    how Sets what step 16 of the row does in the Steps pattern: rest (Off), play a note (On), hold the note before it (Tie) or play it louder (Accent).
