X1          "Step 1 transpose" 0 24 12   int -12 st signed                    | Step 1's transpose in semitones (−12 … +12)
    how Moves the note step 1 plays by this many semitones, up or down, in the Steps pattern.
    sound Steps moved up or down make a melodic line, a leap or an octave jump, out of the held notes.
X2          "Step 2 transpose" 0 24 12   int -12 st signed                    | Step 2's transpose in semitones (−12 … +12)
    how Moves the note step 2 plays by this many semitones, up or down, in the Steps pattern.
